# Real-Time Hand Tracking Mouse Control 🖱️✋

Welcome to the **Real-Time Hand Tracking Mouse Control** project! This Python-based system allows you to control your computer's mouse and perform actions like left-click, right-click, scroll, and drag-and-drop using hand gestures. Built using **MediaPipe**, **OpenCV**, and **pyautogui**, this project brings a new level of interactivity to your device. 🎉

---

## 🔑 **Key Features**:

- **Smooth Mouse Control** 🖱️: Move your cursor in real-time with your index finger.
- **Left-Click** 👆: Pinch your thumb and index finger to simulate a left-click.
- **Right-Click** 👉: Pinch your thumb and pinky to simulate a right-click.
- **Scroll** 🔄: Perform scrolling by making a fist.
- **Drag-and-Drop** 🧳: Drag items by pinching your thumb and index finger.
- **Gesture Mode** 🔄: Easily toggle between different hand gestures to control actions.
- **Real-Time Performance** ⚡: Low-latency for smooth interactions.

---

