🚀 How to Use:
Run the script:

bash
Copy
Edit
python hand_tracker.py
Once running, your camera will activate.

Control the mouse with your hand:

Index Finger: Move the cursor.

Thumb + Index Pinch: Left-click.

Thumb + Pinky Pinch: Right-click.

Fist Gesture: Scroll up or down.

Pinch Thumb & Index: Drag items.

Press 'q' to exit the program.

🔄 Gesture Mode:
Switch between Mouse Mode and Gesture Mode by performing specific hand gestures. Currently, this can be customized and configured to suit your needs.

🛠️ Customization:
This system is highly customizable to suit your preferences:

Adjust Smoothness: Fine-tune the smoothness of the mouse movement.

Gesture Actions: Add more gestures for additional functions.

Keyboard Shortcuts: You can extend the functionality to include keyboard actions (like media control).

